sequenceDiagram
  actor Accountant
  participant Routes as REST Route Layer
  participant Session as Session and Role Resolver
  participant Policy as Segregation of Duties Policy
  participant EntrySvc as Journal Entry Service
  participant EntryRepo as Entry Repository
  participant HistRepo as History Repository

  Accountant->>Routes: POST /api/finance/journal-entries (lines)
  Routes->>Session: resolve caller identity and roles
  Session-->>Routes: userId, roles[accountant]
  Routes->>Policy: authorize create(accountant)
  Policy-->>Routes: allowed
  Routes->>EntrySvc: createDraft(lines, userId)
  EntrySvc->>EntryRepo: insert entry status=draft with lines
  EntryRepo-->>EntrySvc: entry persisted
  EntrySvc-->>Routes: entry (status draft)
  Routes-->>Accountant: 201 Created entry draft

  Accountant->>Routes: POST /api/finance/journal-entries/:id/submit
  Routes->>Session: resolve caller identity and roles
  Session-->>Routes: userId, roles[accountant]
  Routes->>Policy: authorize submit(accountant, entry.createdBy)
  Policy-->>Routes: allowed
  Routes->>EntrySvc: submit(id)
  EntrySvc->>EntryRepo: fetch entry and lines
  EntryRepo-->>EntrySvc: entry, lines
  EntrySvc->>EntrySvc: computeBalance(lines)
  alt debit total != credit total
    EntrySvc-->>Routes: rejected unbalanced, status unchanged
    Routes-->>Accountant: 409 Conflict, entry still draft
  else balanced
    EntrySvc->>EntryRepo: update status=submitted
    EntrySvc->>HistRepo: append insert-only submit row
    HistRepo-->>EntrySvc: appended
    EntrySvc-->>Routes: entry submitted
    Routes-->>Accountant: 200 OK entry submitted
  end
